      "summary": "A benchmark report records the Tangle release it was measured with, and no longer has to equal the current one: the trading and trace2skill rebuilds take the committed report's suite, and their checks require only that the Jaren foundation is this one; CGT compares its runtime without the release. Every source-bound benchmark artifact is regenerated once under the identity that leaves Tangle's version strings out, so a version-only release now regenerates none.",
      "id": "measured-with"
    }
